## Root Cause
The user-generated content is rendered directly without escaping, making it susceptible to XSS attacks.

## Explanation
The patch ensures that all user data passed to the rendering function is properly escaped using a secure templating library. This prevents any malicious scripts from being executed in the user's browser, thus mitigating XSS vulnerabilities.

